        "answer": {
          "short": "Allen’s Snakes Alive: \\$17.20/kg, compared with approximately \\$21.74/kg.",
          "worked": "Convert to kilograms: $230\\text{ g}=0.230\\text{ kg}$ and $500\\text{ g}=0.500\\text{ kg}$.\n\nThe Natural Confectionery Co. Snakes:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Unit price}&=\\frac{5}{0.230}=\\frac{500}{23}\\text{ dollars/kg}\\\\\\text{Unit price}&\\approx\\$21.74/\\text{kg}\\end{align*}$$\nAllen’s Snakes Alive:\n$$\\text{Unit price}=\\frac{8.60}{0.500}=\\$17.20/\\text{kg}.$$\nAllen’s Snakes Alive is the best buy because its price per kilogram is lower.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 58
