        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "The 12-pack: approximately \\$3.17/L, compared with \\$3.85/L.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Pack volume}&=12\\times300\\text{ mL}\\\\\\text{Pack volume}&=3600\\text{ mL}=3.6\\text{ L}\\\\\\text{Pack unit price}&=\\frac{11.40}{3.6}=\\frac{19}{6}\\text{ dollars/L}\\\\\\text{Pack unit price}&\\approx\\$3.17/\\text{L}\\end{align*}$$\nThe bottle costs \\$3.85/L. The 12-pack is the best buy because its price per litre is lower.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
